{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"illsuited-erect-ibis","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Problem\n\n`rebar fsck` reports 8 stray top-level directories in the tickets tracker\n(`/Users/joeoakhart/rebar/.tickets-tracker`), each flagged twice — once as\n`MISSING_CREATE` (no CREATE event found) and once inside the single\n`FOREIGN_STORE_PATH` finding:\n\n    0efe-9207-2706-43a3  2021-2ef0-e36f-44fc  6f8a-45e5-d9ec-402c  a109-e758-71bb-4371\n    afe5-db0b-e9c5-45d8  c827-81ee-a592-4d27  d052-ad3f-23c1-4511  fa38-670c-d8fc-4c22\n\nBaseline: `fsck complete: 16 issues found` = 8 MISSING_CREATE + 6 STATUS_FORK_RESOLVED\n+ 1 FOREIGN_STORE_PATH + 1 ENV_ID_MISMATCH.\n\n## Evidence (pre-removal triage)\n\nAll 8 are **empty directories** (`ls -laR` -> empty; 64-byte dir inode), none is\ncommitted (`git ls-tree HEAD <dir>` empty for all 8), `git status --porcelain` in the\ntracker is clean because git does not track empty directories, and\n`rebar exists <id>` returns exit 1 (not found) for all 8. `lsof +D` on the tracker\nshows no process holding any file under any of the 8 (the only open handle is an\nunrelated live read of `874a-bda3-ee6f-45eb/...-SNAPSHOT.json`). Directory mtimes are\n2026-08-10 11:05 through 2026-08-12 12:52 — all well outside the ~30-minute\nlive-agent suspicion window (triage run at 2026-08-12 17:59 PDT).\n`git rev-list --count origin/tickets..HEAD` = 0, so tracker-maintenance will not refuse.\n\n## Likely cause\n\n`mkdir <ticket-dir>` succeeded and the process died before the CREATE event JSON was\nwritten — the signature of agents interrupted mid-write by tonight's host sleeps,\nsession-limit kills, and shell-cap timeouts across the active fleet.\n\n## Plan (minimal, deterministic — four-guard discipline)\n\nGuard 1: dir is empty. Guard 2: dir is uncommitted (`git ls-tree HEAD` empty).\nGuard 3: `rebar exists <id>` is exit 1. Guard 4: no open file handle (`lsof +D`).\nOnly dirs passing all four are removed, and removal goes through the sanctioned door\n`rebar tracker-maintenance --clean` (backup ref before first write, refusal on\nunpushed ticket commits, durable audit). No raw git in the tracker, no stash.\n`STATUS_FORK_RESOLVED` (benign, auto-resolved) and `ENV_ID_MISMATCH` (known by-design\nflag from change 1638) are explicitly out of scope and must not be touched.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- AC1: A per-directory triage verdict for all 8 dirs is recorded as a comment on this\n  ticket, citing the four guards.\n- AC2: Every confirmed-debris directory is removed via `rebar tracker-maintenance --clean`\n  (or reported back if that command's scope does not cover it); any directory failing a\n  guard is excluded and the reason recorded.\n- AC3: Post-sweep `rebar fsck` reports 0 MISSING_CREATE findings and 0 FOREIGN_STORE_PATH\n  findings; before/after issue counts are recorded on this ticket.\n- AC4: No committed ticket data is modified — the tracker's `git log` HEAD subject and the\n  set of committed ticket directories are unchanged across the operation.","id":"7c6e-4b8a-59c5-46db","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Sweep interrupted-ticket-write debris: 8 uncommitted stray ticket dirs in the tracker"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1786582819695154001,"uuid":"88b98fd9-50d1-4f15-950c-27611d6badc5"}